error[E0211]: `spawn` needs a call, or an actor to start
  --> tests/programs/m91/e0211_spawn.la:4:19
  |
4 |     let t = spawn work;
  |                   ^^^^
  |
  = help: write the call the new thread runs, `spawn work(x)`, call a closure on the spot, `spawn fun() { … }()`, or start an actor: `spawn Counter { count: 0 }`

For more about E0211, run `lughac explain E0211`.
